          "sourceRegion": "Question 7: dot plot to the right of parts a–d.",
          "description": "A single-series dot plot titled “Lateness (in hours)”, with a horizontal axis from 0 to 3, integer labels and unlabelled half-hour ticks. There are no arrowheads, vertical axis or grid lines.",
